em;width:35%; text-align:center;\" class=\"noprint\"><i>2032</i>&#160;&#8594;</div>\n</div></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\"><hr />35<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>a<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> of the 100 seats in the <a href=\"/wiki/United_States_Senate\" title=\"United States Senate\">United States Senate</a><br />51<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>b<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> seats needed for a majority</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg/250px-John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"135\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg/330px-John_Thune_117th_Congress_portrait_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1945\" data-file-height=\"2593\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_(3x4a).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg/250px-Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"135\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg/330px-Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1766\" data-file-height=\"2354\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Leader\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/John_Thune\" title=\"John Thune\">John Thune</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chuck_Schumer\" title=\"Chuck Schumer\">Chuck Schumer</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Leader&#160;since\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/2024_Senate_Republican_Conference_leadership_election\" title=\"2024 Senate Republican Conference leadership election\">January 3, 2025</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">January 3, 2017\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Leader's&#160;seat\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_South_Dakota\" title=\"List of United States senators from South Dakota\">South Dakota</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_New_York\" title=\"List of United States senators from New York\">New York</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Current&#160;seats\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">53\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">45<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Independents&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Independents-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>c<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seats&#160;needed\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Steady\"><img alt=\"Steady\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/20px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/40px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Increase\"><img alt=\"Increase\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Increase2.svg/20px-Increase2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Increase2.svg/40px-Increase2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span> 4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seats up\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">22\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">13\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #DDDDBB;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;width:0;;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Independent (US)\">Independent</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Current&#160;seats\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">2<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Independents&#95;3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Independents-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>c<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seats up\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">0\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><figure class=\"mw-halign-center noresize mw-ext-imagemap-desc-bottom-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/2026_United_States_Senate_elections_retirements_map.svg/330px-2026_United_States_Senate_elections_retirements_map.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"186\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/2026_United_States_Senate_elections_retirements_map.svg/960px-2026_United_States_Senate_elections_retirements_map.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"959\" data-file-height=\"593\" usemap=\"#ImageMap_f512a095068b92de\" resource=\"/wiki/File:2026_United_States_Senate_elections_retirements_map.svg\" /></span><map nam