=\"https://results.sos.ga.gov/results/public/Georgia/elections/2022DecGenRun\">\"Election Results\"</a>. Georgia Secreatary of State<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">August 4,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Election+Results&amp;rft.pub=Georgia+Secreatary+of+State&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fresults.sos.ga.gov%2Fresults%2Fpublic%2FGeorgia%2Felections%2F2022DecGenRun&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-13\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-13\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/jeanne-shaheen-wont-run-re-election-opening-another-democratic-senate-rcna196015\">\"Jeanne Shaheen won't run for re-election, opening another Democratic Senate seat in 2026\"</a>. NBC News. March 12, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Jeanne+Shaheen+won%27t+run+for+re-election%2C+opening+another+Democratic+Senate+seat+in+2026&amp;rft.pub=NBC+News&amp;rft.date=2025-03-12&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nbcnews.com%2Fpolitics%2F2026-election%2Fjeanne-shaheen-wont-run-re-election-opening-another-democratic-senate-rcna196015&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-14\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-14\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.politico.com/live-updates/2025/03/25/congress/susan-collins-polling-00246823\">\"Will Democrats finally get a shot at taking out Susan Collins?\"</a>. <i>Politico</i>. March 25, 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Politico&amp;rft.atitle=Will+Democrats+finally+get+a+shot+at+taking+out+Susan+Collins%3F&amp;rft.date=2025-03-25&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.politico.com%2Flive-updates%2F2025%2F03%2F25%2Fcongress%2Fsusan-collins-polling-00246823&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-politico&#95;carney-15\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-politico_carney_15-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-politico_carney_15-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFCarney,&#95;Jordain2025\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Carney, Jordain (June 29, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/2025/06/29/thom-tillis-retires-00432045\">\"Thom Tillis says he will retire following Trump attacks\"</a>. <i>Politico</i>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Politico&amp;rft.atitle=Thom+Tillis+says+he+will+retire+following+Trump+attacks&amp;rft.date=2025-06-29&amp;rft.au=Carney%2C+Jordain&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.politico.com%2Fnews%2F2025%2F06%2F29%2Fthom-tillis-retires-00432045&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-16\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-16\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241202212003/https://abcnews.go.com/538/republicans-start-favorites-2026-senate-elections/story?id=116243572\">\"Why Republicans start out as favorites in the 2026 Senate elections\"</a>. ABC News. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://abcnews.go.com/538/republicans-start-favorites-2026-senate-elections/story?id=116243572\">the original</a> on December 2, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">February 6,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Why+Republicans+start+out+as+favorites+in+the+2026+Senate+elections&amp;rft.pub=ABC+News&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fabcnews.go.com%2F538%2Frepublicans-start-favorites-2026-senate-elections%2Fstory%3Fid%3D116243572&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-17\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-17\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBerman2025\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Berman, Russell (May 12, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/politics/archive/2025/05/democrats-age-retirement-trump/682771/\">\"Retirement Is the New Resistance\"</a>. <i>The Atlantic</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 13,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Atlantic&amp;rft.atitle=Retirement+Is+the+New+Resistance&amp;rft.date=2025-05-12&amp;rft.aulast=Berman&amp;rft.aufirst=Russell&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theatlantic.com%2Fpolitics%2Farchive%2F2025%2F05%2Fdemocrats-age-retirement-trump%2F682771%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-18\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-18\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/senate-democratic-retirements-clear-way-new-generation-politics-desk-rcna202678\">\"Senate Democratic retirements clear the way for a new generation: From the Politics Desk\"</a>. NBC News. April 24, 2025<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 13,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Senate+Democratic+retirements+clear+the+way+for+a+new+generation%3A+From+the+Politics+Desk&amp;rft.pub=NBC+News&amp;rft.date=2025-04-24&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nbcnews.com%2Fpolitics%2Fpolitics-news%2Fsenate-democratic-retirements-clear-way-new-generation-politics-desk-rcna202678&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-19\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-19\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFEric&#95;CoxEric&#95;Lau2026\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Eric Cox; Eric Lau (July 11, 2026). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/07/11/here-are-races-watch-democrats-grow-more-bullish-retaking-senate/\">\"Democrats are growing bullish on retaking the Senate. Here are the races to watch\"</a>. <i>Washington Post</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 15,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Washington+Post&amp;rft.atitle=Democrats+are+growing+bullish+on+retaking+the+Senate.+Here+are+the+races+to+watch.&amp;rft.date=2026-07-11&amp;rft.au=Eric+Cox&amp;rft.au=Eric+Lau&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.washingtonpost.com%2Fpolitics%2F2026%2F07%2F11%2Fhere-are-races-watch-democrats-grow-more-bullish-retaking-senate%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-20\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-20\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation news cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/09/24/senate-iran-war-powers-fuel-prices-01091163\">\"Battered by gas prices at the polls, GOP faces key Iran war vote\"</a>. Politico. September 24, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 24,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Battered+by+gas+prices+at+the+polls%2C+GOP+faces+key+Iran+war+vote&amp;rft.date=2026-09-24&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.politico.com%2Fnews%2F2026%2F09%2F24%2Fsenate-iran-war-powers-fuel-prices-01091163&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-OK&#95;Statutes-24\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-OK_Statutes_24-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-OK_Statutes_24-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://law.justia.com/codes/oklahoma/title-51/section-51-10/\">\"2025 Oklahoma Statutes Title 51. Officers §51-10. Vacancies - Appointments - Special elections\"</a>. Justia US Law<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">March 25,</span> 2026</span>. <q>Prior to an appointment pursuant to paragraph 1 of subsection C of this section, a person who is a prospective appointee shall submit to the Secretary of State an oath affirming that the person will not file as a candidate for the office when it next appears on the ballot. The Secretary of State shall prescribe the oath required by this paragraph, and any oath submitted shall be public record and published on the website of the Office of the Secretary of State.</q></cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=2025+Oklahoma+Statutes+Title+51.+Officers+%C2%A751-10.+Vacancies+-+Appointments+-+Special+elections.&amp;rft.pub=Justia+US+Law&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Flaw.justia.com%2Fcodes%2Foklahoma%2Ftitle-51%2Fsection-51-10%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-26\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-26\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/03/02/members-of-congress-retirements-record-high\">\"House retirements tied for most this century\"</a>. <i>Axios</i>. March 2, 2026<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">March 9,</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Axios&amp;rft.atitle=House+retirements+tied+for+most+this+century&amp;rft.date=2026-03-02&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.axios.com%2F2026%2F03%2F02%2Fmembers-of-congress-retirements-record-high&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Tuberville-27\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Tuberville_27-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Tuberville_27-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFAngle2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Angle, Alex (May 27, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://aldailynews.com/tuberville-to-announce-run-for-governor-in-2026/\">\"Tuberville to announce run for governor in 2026\"</a>. <i>Alabama Daily News</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 27,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Alabama+Daily+News&amp;rft.atitle=Tuberville+to+announce+run+for+governor+in+2026&amp;rft.date=2025-05-27&amp;rft.aulast=Angle&amp;rft.aufirst=Alex&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Faldailynews.com%2Ftuberville-to-announce-run-for-governor-in-2026%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Durbin-28\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Durbin_28-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Durbin_28-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Durbin_28-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFHulse2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Hulse, Carl (April 23, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/04/23/us/dick-durbin-retires-senate.html\">\"Durbin, No. 2 Senate Democrat, to Retire After 44 Years in Congress\"</a>. <i>The New York Times</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">April 23,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+York+Times&amp;rft.atitle=Durbin%2C+No.+2+Senate+Democrat%2C+to+Retire+After+44+Years+in+Congress&amp;rft.date=2025-04-23&amp;rft.aulast=Hulse&amp;rft.aufirst=Carl&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F2025%2F04%2F23%2Fus%2Fdick-durbin-retires-senate.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ernst-29\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-ernst_29-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-ernst_29-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-ernst_29-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFJacobs2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Jacobs, Jennifer (September 2, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cbs2iowa.com/news/local/joni-ernst-announces-retirement-from-senate-in-2026-pledges-ongoing-community-involv