=Associated+Press&amp;rft.date=2025-02-20&amp;rft.aulast=Schreiner&amp;rft.aufirst=Bruce&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Fmitch-mcconnell-senate-retirement-34c79ef12bf62d14cb71d3c393f23a83&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-GaryPeters-31\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-GaryPeters_31-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-GaryPeters_31-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-GaryPeters_31-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBurke2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Burke, Melissa Nann (January 28, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.detroitnews.com/story/news/politics/2025/01/28/michigan-democratic-senator-gary-peters-will-not-run-for-reelection-to-us-senate-seat-2026/77985876007/\">\"Michigan's Gary Peters won't seek reelection to U.S. Senate. Here's why\"</a>. <i>The Detroit News</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">January 28,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Detroit+News&amp;rft.atitle=Michigan%27s+Gary+Peters+won%27t+seek+reelection+to+U.S.+Senate.+Here%27s+why&amp;rft.date=2025-01-28&amp;rft.aulast=Burke&amp;rft.aufirst=Melissa+Nann&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.detroitnews.com%2Fstory%2Fnews%2Fpolitics%2F2025%2F01%2F28%2Fmichigan-democratic-senator-gary-peters-will-not-run-for-reelection-to-us-senate-seat-2026%2F77985876007%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-tinasmith-33\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-tinasmith_33-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-tinasmith_33-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-tinasmith_33-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBakst2025\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Bakst, Brian (February 13, 2025). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.mprnews.org/story/2025/02/13/tina-smith-will-not-run-for-reelection-in-senate-in-2026\">\"Sen. Tina Smith won't seek reelection in 2026, putting Minnesota seat up for grabs\"</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Minnesota_Public_Radio\" title=\"Minnesota Public Radio\">Minnesota Public Radio</a><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">February 13,</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Sen.+Tina+Smith+won%27t+seek+reelection+in+2026%2C+putting+Minnesota+seat+up+for+grabs&amp;rft.date=2025-02-13&amp;rft.aulast=Bakst&amp;rft.aufirst=Brian&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mprnews.org%2Fstory%2F2025%2F02%2F13%2Ftina-smith-will-not-run-for-reelection-in-senate-in-2026&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2026+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Daines-34\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Daines_34-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Daines_34-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://nbcmontana.com/news/local/daines-withdraws-from-senate-race-as-filing-closes\">\"Daines withdraws from Senate race as filing closes\"</a>. KECI. March 5, 2026<span class=